38.steps:
1. Add site to site VPN policy on local and remote FW, and use an AO Group as the local and remote network;
2. Enable OSPF/RIP on DUT, redistribute the remote VPN network;
3. Use command "show ip route ospf" on router;
4. Disable site to site VPN policy, check router "show ip route ospf".

38.result:
in step 1, make sure the VPN policy is established;
in step 2, make sure OSPF neighbor established;
in step 3, make sure router learned the remote VPN network from DUT;
in step 4, make sure when the VPN is down, the remote VPN network routes disappeared on router.
